    "text": "Brooklyn Daily Eagle\nwebsite\nBrooklyn\nMissing: 15-year-old Crown Heights girl last seen July 20\n8 hours ago\nCROWN HEIGHTS — POLICE ARE SEARCHING for a 15-year-old Brooklyn girl who was last seen at her Crown Heights home on Sunday, July 20, around 10:20 p.m. Tamia Westbrook is described as being approximately 5 feet, 5 inches tall and weighing 200 pounds. A photo from police shows her as having medium skin color, curly black hair and wearing glasses.\n2",
